  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1d779d4715048234dbbf2415be188cb0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tavern
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Title: Tavern
  Prompt: After a day of hard riding, you finally reach your stop for the night -
    a bustling tavern. Stepping inside, you're met with a commotion of travellers
    much like yourself. You see travellers of every shape a size telling tales of
    battle, discussing plans and forming adventuring parties. You realize this might
    be an opportunity to recruit someone to join you. However, you're afraid that
    an adventurer of your own might leave for better prospects.
  Sprite: {fileID: 0}
  ChoicesToDisplay: 2
  Choices:
  - Text: Find a new Companion!
    SuccessChance: 1
    _successText: 
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: You're lucky enough to find an ambitious new recruit to join you, and
        celebrate into the night. The next morning, you realize that one of your
        other companions has left you for better prospects.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 10
        _moneyDelta: 0
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
  - Text: Camp outside.
    SuccessChance: 1
    _successText: 
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: It's really not as muddy as you had thought, and your party warms itself
        by a large fire. You're happy with the friends you have.
      Outcomes: []
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
